      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was officially incorporated in 1901, marking its transition from a rural community to an incorporated municipality.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Argyle%2C_Georgia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office has been operating in Argyle since 1882, serving as a longstanding hub for residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Argyle%2C_Georgia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Originally a sawmill town, Argyle once boasted a meat market, bank, barber shop, grocery, two mercantile stores, pharmacy, and a silent movie theater.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://clinchcountyga.gov/city-of-argyle.html",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1908, the community built Union High School, a landmark that has educated generations of Argyle residents.",
